---
config:
  flowchart:
    nodeSpacing: 150
    rankSpacing: 80
  themeVariables:
    edgeLabelBackground: 'transparent'
---
flowchart TD
    Start([vigilo worker start])

    Loader[Build evaluator loader]
    Runner[Start worker service runner]
    Stream{Consumer stream open?}
    Event{Next worker event?}
    Decode{Delivery JSON valid?}
    Payload{Chunk-ready payload valid?}
    Claim{Chunk claimable?}
    Context[Load run context]
    Warm[Warm evaluator components]
    Cases[Load chunk case batch]
    Execute[Execute case evaluations with bounded chunk-local parallelism]
    Persist[Persist terminal transitions]
    Complete[Mark chunk completed]
    Ack[Acknowledge message]
    Release[Release chunk lease]
    Released{Chunk released?}
    Requeue[Nack and requeue message]
    Reopen[Reopen consumer stream]
    Shutdown[Cancel consumer loop]
    Stop{Service stopped in time?}

    Success([Success response])

    ServiceFail([Service error])
    ShutdownFail([Shutdown error])

    Start --> Loader
    Loader --> Runner
    Runner --> Stream

    Stream -- No --> ServiceFail
    Stream -- Yes --> Event

    Event -- Shutdown signal --> Shutdown
    Event -- Delivery received --> Decode
    Event -- Stream closed --> Reopen

    Reopen --> Stream
    Reopen -. Reopen fails .-> ServiceFail

    Decode -- No --> ServiceFail
    Decode -- Yes --> Payload

    Payload -- No --> Ack
    Payload -- Yes --> Claim

    Claim -- No --> Ack
    Claim -- Yes --> Context
    Claim -. Claim fails .-> ServiceFail

    Context --> Warm
    Context -. Context load fails .-> ServiceFail

    Warm --> Cases
    Warm -. Warmup fails .-> Release

    Cases --> Execute
    Cases -. Load fails .-> Release

    Execute --> Persist
    Execute -. Processing fails .-> Release

    Persist --> Complete
    Persist -. Persistence fails .-> Release

    Complete --> Ack
    Complete -. Completion fails .-> ServiceFail

    Ack --> Event
    Ack -. Ack fails .-> ServiceFail

    Release --> Released
    Release -. Release fails .-> ServiceFail

    Released -- Yes --> Requeue
    Released -- No --> Ack

    Requeue --> Event
    Requeue -. Requeue fails .-> ServiceFail

    Shutdown --> Stop
    Stop -- Yes --> Success
    Stop -- No --> ShutdownFail

    class Start command
    class Success success
    class Loader,Runner,Stream,Event,Decode,Payload,Claim,Context,Cases,Persist,Complete,Ack,Release,Released,Requeue,Reopen,Shutdown,Stop system
    class Warm,Execute component
    class ServiceFail,ShutdownFail error
